<file path="docs/design.md">
  1: # Sprinkle – Design System
  2: 
  3: **Version:** 2.0  
  4: **Last Updated:** 2026  
  5: **Platform:** Flutter (iOS & Android)  
  6: **Primary Font:** SVN‑Gilroy
  7: 
  8: ---
  9: 
 10: ## Brand & Style
 11: 
 12: Sprinkle is a camera‑first memory journal. The design philosophy is **Minimalist Premium** – clean, airy, and polished, inspired by the Locket app. Every element should feel intentional, joyful, and non‑intrusive.
 13: 
 14: **Key principles:**
 15: 
 16: - **Simplicity** – remove anything unnecessary.
 17: - **Consistency** – reuse colours, spacing, and typography religiously.
 18: - **Depth through glass** – use translucent materials and background blurs for overlays.
 19: - **Softness** – high corner radii, no sharp edges.
 20: - **Vibrancy with restraint** – one primary colour used boldly, everything else stays neutral.
 21: 
 22: ---
 23: 
 24: ## Colors
 25: 
 26: ### Brand Colours (Primary & Secondary)
 27: 
 28: | Role             | Hex       | Name                  | Usage                                                                |
 29: | ---------------- | --------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
 30: | **Primary**      | `#FF6B6B` | `AppColors.primary`   | Shutter fill, active tab tint, key CTAs, accents – use **liberally** |
 31: | **On‑Primary**   | `#FFFFFF` | –                     | White text/icons on primary surfaces                                 |
 32: | **Secondary**    | `#4ECDC4` | `AppColors.secondary` | Tags, subtle accents – use **sparingly**                             |
 33: | **On‑Secondary** | `#FFFFFF` | –                     | White text on secondary surfaces                                     |
 34: 
 35: ### Neutral & Support Colours
 36: 
 37: | Role                    | Hex       | Name                         | Usage                                       |
 38: | ----------------------- | --------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
 39: | **Neutral**             | `#1A1A1A` | `AppColors.neutral`          | Primary text (dark, not pure black)         |
 40: | **Neutral Light**       | `#8E8E93` | `AppColors.neutralLight`     | Secondary text, placeholder, inactive icons |
 41: | **Neutral Ultra Light** | `#F2F2F7` | `AppColors.neutralUltraLight`| Backgrounds, dividers                       |
 42: | **Surface**             | `#FFFFFF` | `AppColors.surface`          | Cards, sheets, list items                   |
 43: | **Star Gold**           | `#FF9500` | `AppColors.starGold`         | Star ratings (unchanged)                    |
 44: | **Error**               | `#BA1A1A` | `AppColors.error`            | Destructive actions                         |
 45: | **Error Container**     | `#FFDAD6` | `AppColors.errorContainer`   | Light error background                      |
 46: 
 47: ### Semantic Aliases
 48: 
 49: - `AppColors.background` → `AppColors.neutralUltraLight`
 50: - `AppColors.onBackground` → `AppColors.neutral`
 51: - `AppColors.outline` → `AppColors.neutralLight` (at 30% opacity)
 52: 
 53: ---
 54: 
 55: ## Typography
 56: 
 57: **Font Family:** SVN‑Gilroy (supports Vietnamese, clean geometric sans‑serif with rounded terminals)
 58: 
 59: ### Text Styles
 60: 
 61: | Style               | Size | Weight         | Letter Spacing | Line Height | Usage                                                 |
 62: | ------------------- | ---- | -------------- | -------------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
 63: | **Display Large**   | 34pt | Bold (700)     | -0.5px         | 41px        | Large titles (e.g., "Memories" in the navigation bar) |
 64: | **Headline Large**  | 28pt | Bold (700)     | 0              | 34px        | Section headers (e.g., "June 2026")                   |
 65: | **Headline Medium** | 20pt | Semibold (600) | 0              | 25px        | Card titles, sheet titles                             |
 66: | **Body Large**      | 17pt | Regular (400)  | 0              | 22px        | Body text, form inputs, notes                         |
 67: | **Body Small**      | 15pt | Regular (400)  | 0              | 20px        | Secondary text, descriptions                          |
 68: | **Label Bold**      | 13pt | Semibold (600) | +0.2px         | 18px        | Tags, buttons, small labels                           |
 69: | **Caption**         | 12pt | Regular (400)  | 0              | 16px        | Meta info, dates, timestamps                          |
 70: 
 71: ### Font Usage Guidelines
 72: 
 73: - Use **Bold** for titles and headers.
 74: - Use **Semibold** for section headings and emphasised labels.
 75: - Use **Regular** for all body content.
 76: - Always register and load SVN‑Gilroy via `pubspec.yaml` to match the aesthetic.
 77: 
 78: ---
 79: 
 80: ## Shapes & Corners
 81: 
 82: | Token                        | Value  | Usage                             |
 83: | ---------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |
 84: | **Rounded‑xl (extra large)** | 30pt   | Large sheets, modal presentations |
 85: | **Rounded‑lg (large)**       | 20pt   | Cards, main containers            |
 86: | **Rounded‑md (medium)**      | 14pt   | Buttons, input fields             |
 87: | **Rounded‑sm (small)**       | 12pt   | Images, thumbnails                |
 88: | **Rounded‑full**             | 9999px | Tags, chips, circular elements    |
 89: 
 90: **Note:** All surfaces should have rounded corners – no sharp edges.
 91: 
 92: ---
 93: 
 94: ## Spacing & Layout
 95: 
 96: ### Spacing Scale (based on 4pt unit)
 97: 
 98: | Token   | Value | Usage                                   |
 99: | ------- | ----- | --------------------------------------- |
100: | **xs**  | 4pt   | Minimal spacing between inline elements |
101: | **sm**  | 8pt   | Spacing between related elements        |
102: | **md**  | 16pt  | Card padding, section spacing           |
103: | **lg**  | 24pt  | Spacing between sections                |
104: | **xl**  | 32pt  | Large spacing (e.g., between sections)  |
105: | **xxl** | 48pt  | Section breaks                          |
106: 
107: ### Layout Margins
108: 
109: - **Standard horizontal margin:** 20pt (left and right of screen).
110: - **Card padding:** 16pt (inside cards).
111: - **Safe area buffer:** 40–50pt for floating elements (shutter, thumbnail).
112: - **Spacing between shutter and thumbnail:** 40pt.
113: 
114: ---
115: 
116: ## Elevation & Depth
117: 
118: ### Shadow System
119: 
120: | Level           | Style                                                               | Usage                              |
121: | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
122: | **0 (Base)**    | None (flat)                                                         | Backgrounds, surfaces              |
123: | **1 (Card)**    | Drop shadow: `color: #000000`, opacity 8%, blur 6px, Y‑offset 4px   | Cards, list items, detail surfaces |
124: | **2 (Overlay)** | Glass blur backdrop filter                                          | Tab bar, floating glass controls   |
125: | **3 (Primary)** | Drop shadow: `color: #FF6B6B`, opacity 40%, blur 12px, Y‑offset 0px | Shutter button (glow)              |
126: 
127: **Guidelines:**
128: 
129: - Avoid harsh black shadows – always soft and diffused.
130: - For glass elements, rely on backdrop material blur rather than heavy shadows.
131: - The shutter glow is the only coloured shadow – used sparingly.
132: 
133: ---
134: 
135: ## Components
136: 
137: ### Buttons
138: 
139: #### Shutter Button (Primary Action)
140: 
141: - **Outer ring:** 80pt diameter, 4pt stroke, pure white (`#FFFFFF`).
142: - **Inner fill:** 68pt diameter, solid `Primary` (`#FF6B6B`).
143: - **Glow:** Level 3 shadow (`#FF6B6B` at 40% opacity, 12px blur).
144: - **Position:** Centered horizontally, 40pt from bottom safe area.
145: 
146: #### Glass Buttons (Secondary Controls)
147: 
148: - **Size:** 44pt diameter.
149: - **Background:** Translucent glass container with backdrop blur filter.
150: - **Icon:** 20pt system icon, white (or yellow for flash on).
151: - **Shadow:** Level 2.
152: - **Usage:** Flash toggle, profile avatar.
153: 
154: ### Tags & Chips
155: 
156: - **Height:** 28pt.
157: - **Corner radius:** Capsule (`9999px`).
158: - **Padding:** Horizontal 12pt, vertical 4pt.
159: - **Background:** `Secondary` (`#4ECDC4`) at 20% opacity.
160: - **Text:** `Label Bold` (`13pt`, Semibold, `#4ECDC4`).
161: - **Spacing between tags:** 8pt.
162: 
163: ### Cards (Memory Items)
164: 
165: - **Background:** `Surface` (`#FFFFFF`).
166: - **Corner radius:** `rounded‑lg` (`20pt`).
167: - **Padding:** `md` (`16pt`).
168: - **Shadow:** Level 1.
169: - **Content:** Thumbnail (left, 60x60pt, rounded‑sm), title, rating, date.
170: 
171: ### Input Fields (Forms)
172: 
173: - **Style:** Borderless with a bottom divider (`Neutral Light` at 30% opacity).
174: - **Height:** 44pt (minimum touch target).
175: - **Font:** `Body Large` (`17pt`, Regular).
176: - **Placeholder color:** `Neutral Light`.
177: - **Active state:** Bottom divider becomes `Primary`.
178: 
179: ### Tab Bar
180: 
181: - **Style:** Translucent glassmorphism (`BackdropFilter`), blurred overlay.
182: - **Height:** Standard navigation bar height (approx 83pt including safe area).
183: - **Tabs:** 3 items – Friends, Camera, Memories.
184: - **Active Tint:** `Primary` (`#FF6B6B`).
185: - **Inactive Tint:** `Neutral Light` (`#8E8E93`).
186: - **Icons:** Material / Cupertino icons (`people`, `camera`, `grid_view`).
187: - **Labels:** Sentence case, `Caption` (`12pt`, Regular).
188: 
189: ---
190: 
191: ## Camera Tab – Specific Layout
192: 
193: | Element                       | Specification                                                                                                                                 |
194: | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
195: | **Status Bar**                | Transparent background, white text/icons                                                                                                      |
196: | **Top‑Left Avatar**           | 40pt circle, background `Primary` at 20% opacity, white person icon, 24pt. Label "Friends" below, white, 13pt, 70% opacity                    |
197: | **Top‑Right Flash**           | 20pt icon (`flash_off` or `flash_on`), no background circle. White (off) / Yellow `#FFCC00` (on)                                              |
198: | **Bottom‑Left Thumbnail**     | 50pt circle. Shows last captured image with 2pt white border. Empty state: white camera icon at 30% opacity                                   |
199: | **Bottom‑Center Shutter**     | Outer ring: 80pt, white, 4pt stroke. Inner: 68pt, `Primary` solid fill. Glow: `#FF6B6B` 40% opacity, 12px blur                                |
200: | **Camera Preview Background** | Pure black (`#000000`)                                                                                                                        |
201: 
202: ---
203: 
204: ## Flutter Implementation Equivalents
205: 
206: - **Color Tokens:** Defined in `AppColors` (`lib/utils/colors.dart`) using `Color(0xFF...)`.
207: - **Typography:** Defined in `AppTypography` (`lib/utils/typography.dart`) using `TextStyle(fontFamily: 'SVN-Gilroy', ...)`.
208: - **Cards & Surfaces:** Constructed with `Container`, `DecorationBox`, or `Card` with `BorderRadius.circular()`.
209: - **Shadows:** Constructed using `BoxShadow(color: ..., blurRadius: ..., offset: ...)`.
210: - **Glass Effect:** Constructed using `BackdropFilter` with `ImageFilter.blur(sigmaX: 20, sigmaY: 20)`.
211: 
212: ---
213: 
214: ## Design Checklist
215: 
216: - [x] All colours map to the defined `AppColors` tokens.
217: - [x] SVN‑Gilroy is the primary font; registered in `pubspec.yaml`.
218: - [x] Corner radii follow the rounded scale (30pt, 20pt, 14pt, 12pt, 9999px).
219: - [x] Shadows are soft and consistent across cards and buttons.
220: - [x] Translucent glass blur is used for bottom navigation overlays.
221: - [x] The Camera tab has pure black background and Locket-inspired minimal controls.
222: - [x] The shutter button uses `Primary` `#FF6B6B` fill with 12px blur glow.
223: - [x] The thumbnail displays the latest memory image.
</file>

