  1: # Sprinkle – Project Context (Flutter)
  2: 
  3: ## App Overview
  4: 
  5: Sprinkle is a modern Flutter camera‑first memory journal available on iOS and Android. Users capture photos of cafes, restaurants, or stores, then save them with a name, rating, notes, and tags. The design is minimal, premium, and inspired by the Locket social app.
  6: 
  7: **Platform:** Flutter (iOS & Android)  
  8: **Language:** Dart  
  9: **UI Framework:** Flutter Widgets  
 10: **State Management:** Riverpod (`flutter_riverpod`)  
 11: **Persistence:** Isar Database (`VisitRecord` collection)  
 12: **Camera:** `camera` plugin  
 13: **Permissions:** `permission_handler`  
 14: **Image Processing:** `image` package + `path_provider`  
 15: **Font:** SVN‑Gilroy (registered in `pubspec.yaml`, supports Vietnamese)
 16: 
 17: ---
 18: 
 19: ## Design System (Minimalist Premium)
 20: 
 21: ### Colors
 22: 
 23: | Role                | Hex       | Usage                                                   |
 24: | ------------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
 25: | Primary             | `#FF6B6B` | Shutter fill, active tab tint, key CTAs – use liberally |
 26: | On‑Primary          | `#FFFFFF` | White text/icons on primary                             |
 27: | Secondary           | `#4ECDC4` | Tags, subtle accents – use sparingly                    |
 28: | On‑Secondary        | `#FFFFFF` | White text on secondary                                 |
 29: | Neutral             | `#1A1A1A` | Primary text (dark, not pure black)                     |
 30: | Neutral Light       | `#8E8E93` | Secondary text, placeholder text                        |
 31: | Neutral Ultra Light | `#F2F2F7` | Backgrounds, dividers                                   |
 32: | Surface             | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, sheets, list items                               |
 33: | Star Gold           | `#FF9500` | Star ratings                                            |
 34: | Error               | `#BA1A1A` | Destructive actions                                     |
 35: | Error Container     | `#FFDAD6` | Light error background                                  |
 36: 
 37: ### Typography (SVN‑Gilroy)
 38: 
 39: | Style           | Size | Weight         | Letter Spacing | Usage                     |
 40: | --------------- | ---- | -------------- | -------------- | ------------------------- |
 41: | Display Large   | 34pt | Bold (700)     | -0.5px         | Large titles ("Memories") |
 42: | Headline Large  | 28pt | Bold (700)     | 0              | Section headers           |
 43: | Headline Medium | 20pt | Semibold (600) | 0              | Card titles               |
 44: | Body Large      | 17pt | Regular (400)  | 0              | Body text, forms          |
 45: | Body Small      | 15pt | Regular (400)  | 0              | Secondary text            |
 46: | Label Bold      | 13pt | Semibold (600) | +0.2px         | Tags, buttons             |
 47: | Caption         | 12pt | Regular (400)  | 0              | Meta info, dates          |
 48: 
 49: ### Shapes & Spacing
 50: 
 51: | Token                   | Value                        |
 52: | ----------------------- | ---------------------------- |
 53: | Corner Radius (Large)   | 20–30pt (sheets, cards)      |
 54: | Corner Radius (Small)   | 12–16pt (images, thumbnails) |
 55: | Corner Radius (Capsule) | 9999px (tags, chips)         |
 56: | Spacing Unit            | 4pt (base)                   |
 57: | Standard Margins        | 20pt (left/right)            |
