 59: | Safe Area Buffer        | 40–50pt (floating controls)  |
 60: 
 61: ### Elevation & Shadows
 62: 
 63: | Level       | Style                                        | Usage                            |
 64: | ----------- | -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |
 65: | 0 (Base)    | Flat                                         | Backgrounds, surfaces            |
 66: | 1 (Card)    | `BoxShadow(#000000 8% opacity, blur 6, Y 4)` | Cards, list items                |
 67: | 2 (Overlay) | `BackdropFilter` glass blur                  | Tab bar, floating controls       |
 68: | 3 (Primary) | `BoxShadow(#FF6B6B 40% opacity, blur 12)`    | Shutter button glow              |
 69: 
 70: ---
 71: 
 72: ## Navigation Structure (3‑Tab Bar)
 73: 
 74: | Tab | Icon              | Label    | Content                          |
 75: | --- | ----------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |
 76: | 1   | `people_alt`      | Friends  | Placeholder (future feed)        |
 77: | 2   | `camera_alt`      | Camera   | Full‑screen camera (main screen) |
 78: | 3   | `grid_view`       | Memories | Grouped timeline                 |
 79: 
 80: **Tab Bar Style:** Translucent glassmorphism (`BackdropFilter`).  
 81: **Active Tint:** Primary (`#FF6B6B`).  
 82: **Inactive Tint:** Neutral Light (`#8E8E93`).
 83: 
 84: ---
 85: 
 86: ## Camera Tab – Exact Layout (Locket‑inspired)
 87: 
 88: ### 1. Status Bar
 89: 
 90: - Transparent background with white status bar elements on camera preview.
 91: 
 92: ### 2. Top‑Left – Profile
 93: 
 94: - Avatar: 40pt circle – Primary (`#FF6B6B`) at 20% opacity with a white person icon (24pt).
 95: - Label: "Friends" – white, 13pt, 70% opacity, 4pt below avatar.
 96: 
 97: ### 3. Top‑Right – Flash
 98: 
 99: - Icon: `flash_off` (off) / `flash_on` (on).
100: - Size: 20pt.
101: - Color: White (off) / Yellow `#FFCC00` (on).
102: - Plain icon (no background circle).
103: 
104: ### 4. Bottom Controls (Centered Group)
105: 
106: - Left – Thumbnail: 50pt circle – shows last captured image with 2pt white border. If empty, show placeholder icon.
107: - Center – Shutter: Outer ring (80pt, white, 4pt stroke) + Inner circle (68pt, Primary `#FF6B6B` solid fill).
108: - Right – Empty: 50pt spacer for layout balance.
109: - Spacing: 40pt between thumbnail and shutter.
110: - Padding from bottom safe area: 40pt.
111: 
112: ### 5. Camera Preview Background
113: 
114: - Pure black (`#000000`).
115: 
116: ---
117: 
118: ## Project File Structure & Responsibilities
119: 
120: ```
121: sprinkle/
122: ├── assets/
123: │   └── fonts/                         – SVN-Gilroy font files
124: ├── docs/
125: │   ├── design.md                      – Design system specification
126: │   └── project-context.md             – Project context & guidelines
127: ├── lib/
128: │   ├── main.dart                      – App entry point, Isar init, Riverpod scope
129: │   ├── models/
130: │   │   ├── visit_record.dart          – Isar @collection data model
131: │   │   └── visit_record.g.dart        – Generated Isar schema code
132: │   ├── services/
133: │   │   ├── database_service.dart      – Isar database wrapper & CRUD operations
134: │   │   ├── permission_service.dart    – Camera & gallery permission handling
135: │   │   └── image_service.dart         – Image compression, saving, & deletion
136: │   ├── viewmodels/
137: │   │   ├── camera_viewmodel.dart      – Camera controller, capture, & thumbnail state
138: │   │   ├── visit_list_viewmodel.dart  – Memory records fetching & deletion logic
139: │   │   └── add_edit_viewmodel.dart    – Form state, image picker, & validation
140: │   ├── views/
141: │   │   ├── main_tab_view.dart         – 3-tab navigation root & glass tab bar
142: │   │   ├── camera_view.dart           – Locket-inspired full-screen camera
143: │   │   ├── visit_list_view.dart       – Memories card timeline
144: │   │   ├── add_edit_view.dart        – Modal form sheet for adding/editing
145: │   │   └── visit_detail_view.dart     – Detailed view of a single memory
146: │   ├── widgets/
147: │   │   ├── custom_shutter.dart        – 80pt Locket-style shutter button
148: │   │   ├── custom_thumbnail.dart      – Circular/rounded async thumbnail widget
149: │   │   └── star_rating.dart           – 5-star interactive & display rating bar
150: │   ├── utils/
151: │   │   ├── colors.dart                – Semantic color design tokens
152: │   │   ├── typography.dart            – SVN-Gilroy text styles
153: │   │   └── date_formatter.dart        – DateTime extensions for friendly strings
154: │   └── extensions/
155: │       └── context_extensions.dart    – BuildContext utility extensions
156: ├── pubspec.yaml                       – Dependencies & asset registrations
157: └── README.md
158: ```
159: 
160: ---
161: 
162: ## Architecture Rules (Best Practices)
163: 
164: 1. **Separation of Concerns:** Views = layout + Riverpod consumers. ViewModels (`StateNotifier` / `Notifier`) = state management & business logic.
165: 2. **Concurrency:** Use `async`/`await` for asynchronous file and database operations.
166: 3. **Error Handling:** `try-catch` blocks with UI feedback.
167: 4. **Isar Operations:** Perform database writes inside `writeTxn`.
168: 5. **Image Storage:** Always use `ImageService` for saving, resizing, and deleting local images.
169: 6. **Permissions:** Check `PermissionService` before requesting camera or gallery access.
170: 7. **No Force‑Unwrapping:** Handle nullable parameters safely with guard checks or default values.
171: 
172: ---
173: 
174: ## Current Implementation Goal
175: 
176: We redesigned the camera tab and core memory system for Flutter to match the Locket camera layout (minimal, premium, polished).
177: The app features:
178: 
179: - Full-screen camera preview on pure black background.
180: - Top-left profile avatar + "Friends" label.
181: - Top-right flash toggle.
182: - Bottom-centered thumbnail + shutter button.
183: - Memory timeline list, interactive form sheet, detail view, and Isar database persistence.
</file>

